UID:patmos-chora-feast-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270927
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Ioannis Theologos\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Feast of the patron saint at the Monastery of Saint John. Pilgrimage and procession.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#chora-feast-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#chora-feast-of-agios-ioannis-theologos-chora
